% expect: fail
% fuel: 2000
% Chapter 2: the way out first, the recursive call still first
% in the body. True questions work; a false one never ends.
accumulate pond.

% ANCHOR: above
pred above o:critter, o:critter.
above X Y :- eats X Y.
above X Z :- above X Y, eats Y Z.
% ANCHOR_END: above

% ANCHOR: main
main :-
  above heron algae,
  print "the heron is above the algae",
  above algae fly,
  print "the algae is above the fly".
% ANCHOR_END: main
